# Iron Linux - desktop package list
#
# The Iron desktop: Wayland + Labwc + a small set of native, wlroots-friendly
# utilities. No desktop environment (GNOME/KDE/XFCE/Cinnamon/MATE) is pulled
# in here, deliberately. Every package below is picked for being small,
# working properly under Wayland, and doing exactly one job.
#
# Actual Labwc/waybar/etc configuration (the "Iron UI") is wired up in a
# later task via config/includes.chroot - this list only makes the binaries
# available.

## --- Compositor ---
labwc
xwayland
wayland-utils

## --- Session login (Wayland-native, systemd-logind backed - no seatd
##     needed since systemd already provides seat/session management) ---
greetd
gtkgreet

## --- Authentication agent (polkit) ---
polkitd
lxpolkit

## --- Panel / launcher ---
waybar
fuzzel

## --- Notifications ---
mako-notifier

## --- Terminal ---
foot

## --- File manager + removable media ---
pcmanfm
gvfs
udiskie

## --- Wallpaper / lock screen / power menu ---
swaybg
swaylock
wlogout

## --- Screenshots + clipboard ---
grim
slurp
wl-clipboard

## --- Audio: PipeWire + WirePlumber stack ---
pipewire
pipewire-pulse
pipewire-alsa
wireplumber
pamixer
wob

## --- Networking (graphical control via nm-applet in the waybar tray) ---
network-manager
network-manager-applet

## --- Bluetooth ---
bluez
blueman

## --- Input / hardware controls ---
brightnessctl

## --- Fonts (UI + monospace; branding fonts land in assets/branding/fonts
##     and are wired in via includes.chroot by the branding task) ---
fonts-inter
fonts-jetbrains-mono
fonts-noto-color-emoji
